
Lenaneo taolo-ea-mohopolo: 1.
Lenaneo mohopolo: 16000000.
>> tokens := ['{}↲.:,x() '].
{ :i
	>> khoutu := [''].
	>> x := Palo pakeng-tsa: 1 le: 10.
	{
		>> y := Palo pakeng-tsa: 1 le: (tokens bolelele).
		khoutu eketsa-qetellong: (tokens tlhaku: y).
	} × x.
	{ Mosebetsi ncha: khoutu. } tšoasa: { ['Empty']. }, qala.

} × 10000.
Sephetho ngola: ['OK'], mola-o-mocha.
